/* @catalog — generated by `npm run catalog:generate`; do not edit by hand.
 * Internal
 *   Functions: withStore, seed, unzip, zipFiles, flatArchive, rejectsWithoutHistory
 *   Constants: time, content, opinion, classification, usage
 * Tests
 *   - ZIP roundtrip preserves the complete survey, traceability and cache while repeated imports use fresh IDs
 *   - manually zipped root files and one named folder import safely; unfinished states become paused
 *   - export refuses active states and existing leases, then releases its lease on failure and success
 *   - a paused survey extended past the initial 720-minute form limit remains transferable
 *   - legacy requests without a browser window count import from root files or one folder with the current default
 *   - invalid ZIP bytes, CRC damage and declared expansion limits reject without partial history
 *   - unknown files, multiple surveys, duplicate paths, traversal and ZIP symlinks are rejected atomically
 *   - malformed record schemas, unsafe source links and missing completed report data leave no imported history
 *   - export cannot traverse a symlinked data directory or share an unrelated target file
 * @end-catalog */

